{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2023-02-21 16:30:00', 'title': 'GENUINE PARTS COMPANY ANNOUNCES 67TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF INCREASED DIVIDENDS', 'text': "2023 DIVIDEND INCREASES 6% ATLANTA , FEB. 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENUINE PARTS COMPANY (NYSE: GPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY A 6% INCREASE IN ITS REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FOR 2023. AT ITS FEBRUARY 21, 2023 MEETING, GPC'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS INCREASED THE CASH DIVIDEND PAYABLE TO AN ANNUAL RATE OF $3.80 PER SHARE FROM $3.58 PER SHARE IN 2022."}